{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_166_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，王正月，葬晉悼公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"二、三月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子於淏梁。戊寅，大夫盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"淏梁之會，諸侯失正矣。諸侯會，而曰大夫盟，正在大夫也。諸侯在，而不曰諸侯之大夫，大夫不臣也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"三、晉人執莒子、邾子以歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"四、齊侯伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"五、夏，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"六、五月，甲子，地震。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"七、叔老會鄭伯、晉荀偃、衞寧殖、宋人伐許。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊侯伐我北鄙，圍成。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"九、大雩。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_166_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_166","textTraditional":"十、冬，叔孫豹如晉。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}